NAME: desolation_ruin_nicolae_dome_wrecked
TAGS: desolation_ruin transparent
SUBST: C = c., G = GG., X = x., c = c:60 x, k = c
# Source Lua: : desolation_ruins_setup(_G)
: vault.run("shared.setup")
MAP
............
....C..C....
...GC..CG...
..Ckk..kkC..
..k%%1...kX.
.kk%.....cc.
.k%%2..2.Xc.
.k%%.....XCX
.kk%.....CCX
..k%...XXCX.
..kcccCCCC.X
...X.XX..X..
ENDMAP
